        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^2-25=0$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\alpha+\\beta&=5+(-5)=0\\\\\\alpha\\beta&=5(-5)=-25\\end{aligned}$\n\n$\\begin{aligned}x^2-0x-25&=0\\\\x^2-25&=0\\end{aligned}$",
